00:04:51.524 --> 00:04:52.625
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, no!

00:04:52.625 --> 00:04:54.426
-So it can be intense, too.

00:04:54.426 --> 00:04:56.662
So it's, you know, little boys.
-I'll go in with an open mind.

